      "content": "Right, so it's more about that ripple effect. When you talk about the \"sensitivity to human reaction times\" causing these disruptions, are there specific types of unpredictable driver behavior that tend to cause the most friction? Basically, what's causing those sudden, non-linear drops in flow that are hard to model?",
